  "content": "![Logo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/285e6d569d1a476c6b198a6b8c1eb175571651ad.png)  \nPortfolio 是一个小型的模组与数据包，为游戏添加了一系列全新画作，全部由艺术家 [<u>**Yapetto**</u>](https://bsky.app/profile/yptsh.bsky.social) 创作。这些画作包括《塞纳河上的早晨》《正义》和《冥界》等。\n\n### Portfolio 的不同画集\n<details>\n<summary>静物画集 - 1.0</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d2f8f2dbc290f509a929ee382f93b6185894bb1c.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>虚空庄园画集 - 1.1</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a088b34631297e611524006dd859f600fb67e4ce.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>死亡画集 - 1.2</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eecdb51577c9fcf86767fe82e9b5d5349927b08b.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>拉娜画集 - 1.3</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4af9c8dbb3a374a9018853f2285e7b844314ed6d.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>远方之地画集 - 1.3.5</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/136c997b05135cad0e425556bd6d05bc8db81faa.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>锚点画集 - 1.4</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aae2bb2faf08324cbfdc23a6572b5e22aebbdd9f.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>巨人画集 - 1.5</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/800fb441ad894cc87953fcb35678859a72ae93f1.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>元素画集 - 1.5</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61fa1b2f6ea7171c3a02bd16ff83affc4c3ae5a9.png\">\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>云雀谷画集 - 1.5.5</summary>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b03c9b68ed15bf04b645c12a887aaf74d42dc1db.png\">\n</details>",
